# Ignore everything by default. This repo tracks ONLY the workspace
# definition — the Meshtastic repos inside are independent git repos and
# must never be added here.
#
# This also keeps `nix` fast: for a flake in a git repo, Nix copies only
# tracked files into the store. Without this, evaluating the flake would
# copy the whole 15G tree.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.envrc
!/flake.nix
!/flake.lock
!/android-sdk-packages.txt
